tform-user-interface/navigate-using-url.md","line":30},{"title":"Navigation stack","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-user-interface/c_NavigationStack.md","line":31},{"title":"Action - getGlideURI\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ActionAPIBoth.md","line":33},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":35},{"title":"GlideURI - get\\(String name\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideURIScopedAPI.md","line":116},{"title":"GlideURI - getFileFromPath\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideURIScopedAPI.md","line":139},{"title":"Action - getGlideURI\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ActionAPIBoth.md","line":153},{"title":"Action - getGlideURI\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ActionAPIBoth.md","line":176},{"title":"GlideURI - set\\(String name, String value\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideURIScopedAPI.md","line":193},{"title":"View management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-user-interface/view-management-overview.md","line":199},{"title":"Action - getGlideURI\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ActionAPIBoth.md","line":203},{"title":"GlideModalV3 - switchView\\(\\)","target":"c_GlideModalV3API","line":204},{"title":"Action - getGlideURI\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ActionAPIBoth.md","line":214},{"title":"Action - getGlideURI\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ActionAPIBoth.md","line":244},{"title":"GlideURI - toString\\(String path\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideURIScopedAPI.md","line":253},{"title":"GlideModal - Client","target":"c_GlideModalV3API","line":257}],"metadata":{"title":"GlideURI - Global","description":"The GlideURI API provides methods to handle URI parameters in a global application.Deletes one or more parameters from the URI that match the beginning of the provided string.Removes a specified parameter from the query portion of the URI.Returns the value of the specified parameter.Returns the file name portion of the URI.Returns a map \\(key value pairs\\) containing each parameter in the query and its associated value.Sets the specified parameter to the specified value.Adds the sysparm\\_view parameter to the query with the named view.Reconstructs the URI string and performs the proper URL encoding by converting non-valid characters to their URL code. For example, converting &amp; to '%26'.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideURIGlobalAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":4,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{